    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "AUSBOSS_NODES_WorkflowNote",
      "pos": [
        -1680,
        100
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        1100
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "AUSBOSS_NODES_WorkflowNote",
        "cnr_id": "ausboss-nodes",
        "ver": "2.0.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"v\": 1, \"title\": \"MiniMax H3 Image to Video\", \"subtitle\": \"A picture becomes a short clip with its own sound. Image Resize sets H3's native canvas, Math Expression turns seconds into H3's frame grid, Save Video keeps the audio.\", \"author\": \"AusBoss\", \"layout\": \"card\", \"accent\": \"\", \"body\": \"## Setup\\nCopy the supplied media from `example_workflows/inputs/` into `ComfyUI/input/`. Choose each installed model in its loader; saved selections may include local subfolders. Download links below name the standard destination folders.\\n\\n## How it works\\n1. **Models** — the pruned int8 H3 model, its 32B Qwen3-VL text encoder, and the two VAEs (H3 generates picture *and* stereo sound in one pass, so there is a video VAE and an audio VAE). **LoRA Loader** adds the LightX2V turbo LoRA on the model only, and **Sigma Shift** is lowered to 6 for it.\\n2. **First frame** — **Image Resize** brings the picture to H3's native canvas: a 768 px short edge in steps of 32. **Image Size** reads the result back and drives the width and height of the video node, so the clip has exactly the shape of the picture.\\n3. **Length** — H3 only accepts frame counts of 17·k + 5 at 24 fps. Type the seconds you want into **Float**; **Math Expression** turns them into the next valid count (3 s → 73 frames).\\n4. **Prompt** — one block describing the shot, the motion and the audio. H3 reads the audio sentence as literally as the picture one.\\n5. **Sample + decode** — 4 steps, CFG 1, `euler` / `simple`. The latent is decoded twice: frames through the video VAE, sound through the audio VAE.\\n6. **Save Video** — mp4 at 24 fps with the generated audio muxed in and the workflow embedded. About 40 s for 73 frames at 768×1120 on a 32 GB card; the text encoder is the slow part the first time.\\n\\n## Try\\n- **Longer**: 5 s → 124 frames. VRAM and time grow with length; 8 s is about the practical ceiling at 768p on 32 GB.\\n- **Quality over speed**: swap in the 8-step turbo LoRA (same folder), set 8 steps. Without any LoRA H3 wants 20 steps and the default shift of 12.\\n- **Last frame too**: wire a second picture into `last_frame` and H3 animates between them.\\n- **Text to video**: disconnect `first_frame`; width and height then come from the Image Size node's picture, so replace it with an Integer pair or type them in.\\n\\nFrame count rounds up to the next valid 17k+5 value, so a requested six seconds produces 158 frames (6.58 seconds), never a shorter clip. This quick example starts at three seconds, below H3’s usual training range; start around five seconds when judging motion quality.\", \"models\": [{\"name\": \"minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"diffusion_models\", \"size\": \"21 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\", \"note\": \"fp8_scaled (21 GB) and nvfp4 builds of the pruned fl2va model also work\"}, {\"name\": \"qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"text_encoders\", \"size\": \"15.7 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\", \"note\": \"does not need a Blackwell card\"}, {\"name\": \"minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"vae\", \"size\": \"5.2 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\", \"note\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"vae\", \"size\": \"605 MB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\", \"note\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"loras\", \"size\": \"2.0 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"note\": \"LightX2V turbo LoRA; the 8-step build from the same folder trades speed for a little quality\"}], \"packs\": [{\"name\": \"ComfyUI-AusBoss\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss\", \"node\": \"AUSBOSS_NODES_MathExpression\"}], \"links\": [{\"label\": \"GitHub · ausboss\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/ausboss\"}, {\"label\": \"Civitai · AusBoss\", \"url\": \"https://civitai.com/user/AusBoss\"}, {\"label\": \"X · Zanzibased\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/Zanzibased\"}]}"
      ]
    }
  ],
